---@field billingPeriod? string Billing period in YearMonth(e.g. 202008) format. Only for legacy enterprise customers can use this. Can only have one of either timePeriod or invoiceId or billingPeriod parameters. If none provided current month cost is provided.
---@field invoiceId? string Invoice ID for Pay-as-you-go and Microsoft Customer Agreement scopes. Can only have one of either timePeriod or invoiceId or billingPeriod parameters. If none provided current month cost is provided.
